      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Gill & Glynn are delighted to bring to the market this attractive 0.5-acre site with full planning permission at Ballycurrin, Headford, Co. Galway. \n\nThe site enjoys a peaceful rural setting with excellent views of the surrounding countryside and towards Lough Corrib and the distant Connemara mountains.\n\nPlanning permission is in place for a three-bedroom detached dwelling extending to approximately 125 sq.m. Planning has been extended to August 2027.\n\nThe site is held under folio MY14098F, and planning reference no. is 17426 ( Mayo County Council). \n\nLocal housing need requirements apply, and interested parties are advised to satisfy themselves as to their eligibility prior to making an offer.\n\nThe site is conveniently located within easy reach only 7 kms from Headford town and 33 kms from Galway city. Local amenities include Kilroe National School, Greenfields Hote. While the Greenfields pier and Ballycurrin Lighthouse are all located nearby offering an excellent opportunity to build a family home in a scenic countryside location. \n\nAttention is drawn to this important notice. \nProperty Partners Gill & Glynn for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that:\n(i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract.\n(ii) All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. \n(iii) All measurements are approximate and photographs and maps provided are for guidance only.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
